This repository is a software engineering portfolio built with Next.js App Router, React 19, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS 4, GSAP, Three.js, React Three Fiber, Drei, Lenis, and Lucide React.

## Source ownership

- Project display data belongs in `data/projects/*.ts`.
- Project node-and-edge topology belongs in `lib/project-architecture.ts` and must use valid project IDs.
- Identity, education, internship, and chronology content belongs in `lib/content.ts`.
- Keep server-rendered routes and ordinary presentation as Server Components.

## Interface rules

- Preserve the graphite-and-lime visual identity, Poppins body font, Manrope display font, current route behavior, and the 3D B experience.
- Use Tailwind CSS 4 utilities for routine layout and the existing CSS variables through `@theme inline` aliases.
- Keep specialized orbital, SVG, canvas, shader, and GSAP styles in CSS.
- Do not add Tailwind v3 configuration or claim shadcn/ui is used.
- Prefer semantic HTML, mobile-first layouts, visible keyboard focus, reduced-motion support, and accessible names for icon-only controls.
- Avoid inline styling except for runtime-dependent positions or animation values.
- Do not invent project facts, links, features, metrics, or user responsibilities.

## Validation

Run `npm run lint` and `npx tsc --noEmit --incremental false` after meaningful changes. Check installed Next.js documentation in `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` before changing Next.js APIs.
